            "value" : "O Dish não consegue saber que dispositivo é este."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dish closed unexpectedly last time. The report below has had your home folder, network addresses and key-like values removed." : {
      "comment" : "Crash report page intro (the sibling sentence, one word shorter to fit a line).",
      "localizations" : {
        "bs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dish se prošli put neočekivano zatvorio. Iz izvještaja ispod uklonjeni su vaš početni folder, mrežne adrese i sve vrijednosti nalik ključevima."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dish wurde beim letzten Mal unerwartet beendet. Aus dem Bericht unten wurden dein Home-Ordner, Netzwerkadressen und alle schlüsselartigen Werte entfernt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dish se cerró inesperadamente la última vez. Al informe de abajo se le han quitado tu carpeta personal, las direcciones de red y cualquier valor que parezca una clave."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dish s'est fermé inopinément la dernière fois. Le rapport ci-dessous a été expurgé de votre dossier personnel, des adresses réseau et de toute valeur ressemblant à une clé."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Dish fechou inesperadamente da última vez. O relatório abaixo teve a sua pasta pessoal, os endereços de rede e quaisquer valores parecidos com chaves removidos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dish couldn’t read it directly, so macOS reads it" : {
      "comment" : "A card and Diagnostics: why a Nintendo pad Dish's own reader never opened is read through macOS.",
      "localizations" : {
        "bs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dish ga nije mogao direktno čitati, pa ga čita macOS"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dish konnte ihn nicht direkt lesen, also liest macOS ihn"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dish no pudo leerlo directamente, así que lo lee macOS"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
