          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For the PC-to-PC leg, connect both machines to the router with Ethernet if you can." : {
      "comment" : "Help & FAQ: is wired better answer (one sentence of a paragraph).",
      "localizations" : {
        "bs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Na dionici PC–PC, povežite oba računara na usmjerivač Ethernetom ako možete."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auf der Strecke PC-zu-PC verbinde beide Rechner nach Möglichkeit per Ethernet mit dem Router."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En el tramo de PC a PC, conecta ambos equipos al router con Ethernet si puedes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pour le trajet PC-vers-PC, reliez les deux machines au routeur en Ethernet si vous le pouvez."
